{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "默认模块",
    "description": "通义万相视频生成 API 提供文生视频、图生视频、首尾帧生视频等功能。\n\n## 主要功能\n- **文生视频**: 根据文本提示词生成视频\n- **图生视频**: 基于首帧图像生成视频\n- **首尾帧生视频**: 根据首尾帧图像生成过渡视频\n\n## 异步处理说明\n所有视频生成任务都是异步处理：\n1. 创建任务，获取 task_id\n2. 使用 task_id 轮询查询结果，直到任务完成\n\n## 支持的模型\n### 文生视频模型\n- wan2.5-t2v-preview: 支持5秒/10秒，支持自动配音\n- wan2.2-t2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，极速版\n- wan2.2-t2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，专业版\n- wanx2.1-t2v-turbo: 5秒固定时长\n- wanx2.1-t2v-plus: 5秒固定时长\n\n### 图生视频模型\n- wan2.5-i2v-preview: 支持5秒/10秒，支持音频\n- wan2.2-i2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，极速版\n- wan2.2-i2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，专业版\n- wanx2.1-i2v-turbo: 支持3/4/5秒\n- wanx2.1-i2v-plus: 5秒固定时长\n\n### 首尾帧生视频模型\n- wan2.2-kf2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，支持480P/720P/1080P\n- wanx2.1-kf2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，仅支持720P\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Video Generation"
    },
    {
      "name": "Video Editing"
    },
    {
      "name": "Video Extension"
    },
    {
      "name": "Video Tasks"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/xai-video/v1/videos/generations": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "创建视频生成任务",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "统一的视频生成入口. 常见模式包括 text to video, image to video, reference images. 注意 image 与 reference_images 不应同时传入. 成功后返回 request_id, 需要继续轮询结果.",
        "operationId": "createXaiVideoGenerationTask",
        "tags": [
          "Video Generation"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "model": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "模型名称",
                        "enum": [
                          "grok-imagine-video"
                        ]
                      },
                      "prompt": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "提示词"
                      },
                      "duration": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "视频时长",
                        "minimum": 1,
                        "maximum": 15
                      },
                      "aspect_ratio": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "视频宽高比",
                        "enum": [
                          "1:1",
                          "2:3",
                          "3:2",
                          "3:4",
                          "4:3",
                          "16:9",
                          "9:16"
                        ]
                      },
                      "resolution": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "分辨率",
                        "enum": [
                          "480p",
                          "720p"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "title": "文生视频",
                    "required": [
                      "model",
                      "prompt",
                      "duration",
                      "aspect_ratio",
                      "resolution"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "model": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "grok-imagine-video"
                        ],
                        "title": "模型名称"
                      },
                      "prompt": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "提示词"
                      },
                      "image": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "url": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "参考图链接"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "url"
                        ]
                      },
                      "duration": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "视频时长",
                        "minimum": 1,
                        "maximum": 15
                      },
                      "aspect_ratio": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "视频宽高比",
                        "enum": [
                          "1:1",
                          "2:3",
                          "3:2",
                          "3:4",
                          "4:3",
                          "9:16",
                          "16:9"
                        ]
                      },
                      "resolution": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "720p",
                          "480p"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "title": "图生视频",
                    "required": [
                      "model",
                      "prompt",
                      "image",
                      "duration",
                      "aspect_ratio",
                      "resolution"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "model": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "grok-imagine-video"
                        ],
                        "title": "模型名称"
                      },
                      "prompt": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "提示词"
                      },
                      "reference_images": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "url": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "title": "参考图链接"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "url"
                          ]
                        },
                        "maxItems": 7,
                        "minItems": 1
                      },
                      "duration": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "视频时长",
                        "minimum": 1,
                        "maximum": 10
                      },
                      "aspect_ratio": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "视频宽高比",
                        "enum": [
                          "1:1",
                          "2:3",
                          "3:2",
                          "3:4",
                          "4:3",
                          "16:9",
                          "9:16"
                        ]
                      },
                      "resolution": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "视频分辨率",
                        "enum": [
                          "480p",
                          "720p"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "title": "参考图生视频",
                    "required": [
                      "model",
                      "prompt",
                      "reference_images",
                      "duration",
                      "aspect_ratio",
                      "resolution"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "textToVideo": {
                  "value": {
                    "model": "grok-imagine-video",
                    "prompt": "A glowing crystal-powered rocket launching from the red dunes of Mars",
                    "duration": 10,
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
                    "resolution": "720p"
                  },
                  "summary": "文生视频"
                },
                "imageToVideo": {
                  "value": {
                    "model": "grok-imagine-video",
                    "prompt": "The woman slowly turns her head and smiles",
                    "image": {
                      "url": "https://cdn.example.com/source-image.jpg"
                    },
                    "duration": 5,
                    "aspect_ratio": "9:16",
                    "resolution": "480p"
                  },
                  "summary": "图生视频"
                },
                "referenceImages": {
                  "value": {
                    "model": "grok-imagine-video",
                    "prompt": "The model from IMAGE_1 walks on a runway wearing the shirt from IMAGE_2",
                    "reference_images": [
                      {
                        "url": "https://cdn.example.com/model-reference.jpg"
                      },
                      {
                        "url": "https://cdn.example.com/shirt-reference.jpg"
                      }
                    ],
                    "duration": 10,
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
                    "resolution": "720p"
                  },
                  "summary": "参考图生成"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务创建成功. 仅表示任务已入队.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "request_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "任务 Id"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "request_id"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "request_id": "e3a7ee32-9196-925e-ae76-53ad9be3cc71"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/xai-video/v1/videos/edits": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "创建视频编辑任务",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "对已有视频进行编辑. 适合改服装, 改背景, 改天气, 改局部内容. 成功后返回 request_id, 需继续轮询.",
        "operationId": "createXaiVideoEditTask",
        "tags": [
          "Video Editing"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "grok-imagine-video"
                    ],
                    "title": "模型名称"
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "提示词"
                  },
                  "video": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "url": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "视频链接",
                        "description": "- 输入视频必须有.mp4\n扩展并编码.mp4\n- 输入视频的最大长度为8.7秒\n支持的编解码器，如H.265/H.264/AV1等"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "url"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "model",
                  "prompt",
                  "video"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "model": "grok-imagine-video",
                "prompt": "Change the sky to a dramatic orange sunset while keeping the person unchanged",
                "video": {
                  "url": "https://cdn.example.com/source-video.mp4"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "编辑任务创建成功.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "request_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "任务 Id"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "request_id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/xai-video/v1/videos/extensions": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "创建视频续写任务",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "对已有视频进行续写. duration 表示续写段时长, 不是最终总时长.",
        "operationId": "createXaiVideoExtensionTask",
        "tags": [
          "Video Extension"
        ],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "模型名称",
                    "enum": [
                      "grok-imagine-video"
                    ]
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "提示词"
                  },
                  "duration": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "title": "续写时长",
                    "minimum": 2,
                    "maximum": 10,
                    "default": 6
                  },
                  "video": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "url": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "续写视频时长",
                        "description": "- 续写段时长, 不是最终总时长\n- 输入视频的持续时间必须在2到15秒之间"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "url"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "model",
                  "prompt",
                  "duration",
                  "video"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "model": "grok-imagine-video",
                "prompt": "The camera slowly pulls back and reveals a lake in the distance",
                "duration": 5,
                "video": {
                  "url": "https://cdn.example.com/source-video.mp4"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "续写任务创建成功.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "request_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "任务 Id"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "request_id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/xai-video/v1/videos/{request_id}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询视频任务结果",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "根据 request_id 查询任务状态. 常见状态为 pending, done, failed, expired. 当 status 为 done 时可读取 video.url 与 usage.cost_in_usd_ticks.",
        "operationId": "getXaiVideoTaskResult",
        "tags": [
          "Video Tasks"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "request_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "创建任务时返回的 request_id. 必须传真实任务 ID.",
            "required": true,
            "example": "e3a7ee32-9196-925e-ae76-53ad9be3cc71",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询成功.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "任务状态",
                      "enum": [
                        "pending",
                        "done",
                        "failed",
                        "expired"
                      ]
                    },
                    "progress": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "title": "生成进度"
                    },
                    "model": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "模型名称"
                    },
                    "video": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "url": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "duration": {
                          "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "respect_moderation": {
                          "type": "boolean"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "duration",
                        "url",
                        "respect_moderation"
                      ]
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "cost_in_usd_ticks": {
                          "type": "number"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "cost_in_usd_ticks"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "status",
                    "model"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "pending": {
                    "summary": "处理中",
                    "value": {
                      "status": "pending",
                      "progress": 40,
                      "model": "grok-imagine-video"
                    }
                  },
                  "done": {
                    "summary": "已完成",
                    "value": {
                      "status": "done",
                      "video": {
                        "url": "https://download.example.com/video.mp4",
                        "duration": 2,
                        "respect_moderation": true
                      },
                      "model": "grok-imagine-video",
                      "usage": {
                        "cost_in_usd_ticks": 1400000000
                      },
                      "progress": 100
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {},
    "responses": {
      "记录不存在": {
        "description": "",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "code": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "code",
                "message"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "参数不正确": {
        "description": "",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "code": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "code",
                "message"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "使用Bearer Token进行认证,格式为 \"Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\""
      },
      "bearer": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer"
      }
    }
  },
  "servers": [],
  "security": []
}